{"asset_key":"ep5/herohub_story_15411160","episode":"ep5","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"15411160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1541116001:1":{"text":"如今呼临食物紧缺，即便是我，也没有足够的食物招待你们。","source_cn":"如今呼临食物紧缺，即便是我，也没有足够的食物招待你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89E1A2C12A4FFA1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1541116002:1":{"text":"无需在意，这绝非你们的过错。","source_cn":"无需在意，这绝非你们的过错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFADC13F6390A1DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1541116003:1":{"text":"只是，没能品尝到远近闻名的呼临叶饼，的确令人遗憾。","source_cn":"只是，没能品尝到远近闻名的呼临叶饼，的确令人遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04518AA7F3E0FBC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1541116003":{"text":"只是，没能品尝到远近闻名的呼临叶饼，的确令人遗憾。","source_cn":"只是，没能品尝到远近闻名的呼临叶饼，的确令人遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04518AA7F3E0FBC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1541116004:1":{"text":"叶饼是呼临的特产。在周围所有城邦里，最出名的除了图塔镇的小麦，就是呼临叶饼。","source_cn":"叶饼是呼临的特产。在周围所有城邦里，最出名的除了图塔镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA0C2C568EB1D94F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1541116005:1":{"text":"别听它名叫叶饼，但其实，和很多人以为的树叶没有关系。","source_cn":"别听它名叫叶饼，但其实，和很多人以为的树叶没有关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x445FBECDB833A0A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1541116006:1":{"text":"实际上，叶饼是用许多种绿色蔬菜碾碎后的残渣和汁液，混进面团里制成的。只是因为呼临人喜欢将它做成树叶的外形，才得名叶饼。","source_cn":"实际上，叶饼是用许多种绿色蔬菜碾碎后的残渣和汁液，混进...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EDA7C492EC9E419","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1541116007:1":{"text":"叶饼的味道非常甜，而且气味浓郁。即使只是路过售卖叶饼的铺子，都能闻到蔬菜和麦团的香气……","source_cn":"叶饼的味道非常甜，而且气味浓郁。即使只是路过售卖叶饼的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E436EED529F83AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1541116008:1":{"text":"可是现在……别说蔬菜和小麦，呼临已经连一根野草都种不出来了。","source_cn":"可是现在……别说蔬菜和小麦，呼临已经连一根野草都种不出来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25F79EF4E05AAFBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1541116009:1":{"text":"回想我的童年，在田里捉虫、播撒麦种……仿佛梦一样。","source_cn":"回想我的童年，在田里捉虫、播撒麦种……仿佛梦一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA3EE8AA3C355E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1541116009":{"text":"回想我的童年，在田里捉虫、播撒麦种……仿佛梦一样。","source_cn":"回想我的童年，在田里捉虫、播撒麦种……仿佛梦一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA3EE8AA3C355E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1541116010:1":{"text":"没错。那是我心中最美好的记忆。","source_cn":"没错。那是我心中最美好的记忆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF35F570AD18D35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1541116011:1":{"text":"请相信我，珀尔修斯。清除堕神诅咒之后，呼临将恢复它原本的模样。","source_cn":"请相信我，珀尔修斯。清除堕神诅咒之后，呼临将恢复它原本...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8932F5EEF8BF59D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1541116012:1":{"text":"它曾拥有的光辉和美名，都将再度伴随它。","source_cn":"它曾拥有的光辉和美名，都将再度伴随它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27F54AE4C7D9ECA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1541116013:1":{"text":"……希望如此。","source_cn":"……希望如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CFB94832ECD7F7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1541116014:1":{"text":"尽管你们眼前的呼临已荒芜不堪，几乎被苦难蒙尘。但总有一日，它会从沉睡中醒来。","source_cn":"尽管你们眼前的呼临已荒芜不堪，几乎被苦难蒙尘。但总有一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x210A03D45DCB445D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1541116015:1":{"text":"我会守卫它，直至它醒来……或是直到我死去。","source_cn":"我会守卫它，直至它醒来……或是直到我死去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB00C56EA0C2F7965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1541116016:1":{"text":"这是我在童年时，就曾向比博老师、向先领主许下的诺言。","source_cn":"这是我在童年时，就曾向比博老师、向先领主许下的诺言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7941E5E2E8C8E45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"听起来很美好","source_cn":"听起来很美好","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9611BD0C00C42BE6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"听起来很美好","female":"听起来很美好","variant_male_record_index":"79221","variant_female_record_index":"79222","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"我很遗憾","source_cn":"我很遗憾","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x70940EB22CFB11D8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我很遗憾","female":"我很遗憾","variant_male_record_index":"79223","variant_female_record_index":"79224","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"呼临叶饼？","source_cn":"呼临叶饼？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x704C42FC3B9E7E79","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male